{"unit_id":"xiaohuang-zaianlian__dsh-code-scan#readme-1","repo":"xiaohuang-zaianlian/dsh-code-scan","commit":"c236c41f771715dc724d7351300e4d85ba449ceb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-scan README · dsh-code-scan：给 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)（DSH）的 Agent 增加 `code_scan` 工具：对指定目录运行 [semgrep](https://semgrep.dev) 代码安全扫描，输出按文件、行号、严重级别分组的中文 Markdown 报告。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-code-scan"}
{"unit_id":"xiaohuang-zaianlian__dsh-code-scan#readme-2","repo":"xiaohuang-zaianlian/dsh-code-scan","commit":"c236c41f771715dc724d7351300e4d85ba449ceb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-scan README · 功能：- 单个工具 `code_scan`，传入目录路径即可扫描。\n- 报告按文件分组，含行号和严重级别（ERROR / WARNING / INFO）。\n- 结果按严重级别优先排序，默认最多显示 200 条，避免撑爆 Agent 上下文。\n- 未安装 semgrep 时返回友好的中文提示，不会崩溃。","source":"extracted","section":"功能"}
{"unit_id":"xiaohuang-zaianlian__dsh-code-scan#readme-3","repo":"xiaohuang-zaianlian/dsh-code-scan","commit":"c236c41f771715dc724d7351300e4d85ba449ceb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-scan README · 安装前提：本机需安装 semgrep，并保证 `semgrep` 命令在 PATH 上。Windows 建议用独立虚拟环境安装，避免污染其他 Python 环境：\n\n```powershell\npython -m venv C:\\Users\\<你>\\semgrep-venv\nC:\\Users\\<你>\\semgrep-venv\\Scripts\\pip install semgrep","source":"extracted","section":"安装前提"}
