{"unit_id":"xiaohuang-zaianlian__dsh-code-scan#readme-9","repo":"xiaohuang-zaianlian/dsh-code-scan","commit":"c236c41f771715dc724d7351300e4d85ba449ceb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-code-scan README · 工作原理：1. 调用 `semgrep scan --json <目录>`。\n2. 解析 JSON，提取文件、行号、严重级别、规则 id、描述。\n3. 按严重级别优先排序，并截断到上限条数。\n4. 生成中文 Markdown 报告返回给 Agent。","source":"extracted","section":"工作原理"}
